# FIELD-WINTER: FIELD_Barn_Winter = FIELD_Barn under the world's snow layer (Common/WeatherSnow.glslh): the scene's
# collection WP_Winter names the CC0 ambientCG Snow010A albedo / normal / ARM as Texture world parameters and
# SnowCover 0.9; the look is the scan, the code only places it by the up-facing normal (owner 10-29).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn_Winter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 25
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 110
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.25,-1
Тогда-вид 1_winter_eye ground, barn roof and branches carry the scanned snow (grain, sparkle-free white, soft relief) on up-facing faces; walls and trunks stay bare; blades poke out; editor.log errors 0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 2_winter_high the whole field under snow, no tiling grid visible at 9 m, roof white, wall faces bare
# Third-person walk (owner 10-29): both scenes carry the Walker pawn (Character Controller + the engine's Humanoid
# skinned mesh driven by Humanoid_Locomotion, Speed fed by the controller; SpringArm camera behind and above);
# Scripts/Examples/WalkRoute.lua walks it 15 m straight ahead after 0.5 s. Play SAVES nothing.
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 1
Тогда 3_winter_walk_before the walker stands on the snowy ground (feet on the surface, not floating, not sunk), seen from behind and above
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда 4_winter_walk_after the walker has walked ~15 m over the snow and stands on it; no trail in the snow yet (no deformation buffer)
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 1
Тогда 5_summer_walk_before the walker stands on the summer field among the grass, feet on the ground
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда 6_summer_walk_after the walker has walked ~15 m through the grass and stands on the ground; grass not bent by the feet yet
